      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hiNzambi wukweti mukawu, watendaŋa; Yehova watendaŋa, walendumukaŋa; Yehova waditendaŋa hadi akwankunyi nindi, walaminaŋa ayilumbu jindi kuzuwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hazuwaŋa swayuku, wasweja Ŋovu, hakayiŋisha akwanyiloŋa nihantuku. Yehova muwendelu windi muchinjimbi, nimunvula yeneni yasweja mpepela, mavu diwu lunkuŋu lwakumadachilu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahosholaŋa kaluŋalwiji, hakuuma nichau, womishaŋa tuloŋa twejima. Bashani hakuzeela. Karameli niwuluya wakuLebanoni hiwukuzeela nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapidi amaneni hiyakukanka kumesu indi, mpidi janyanya hijikusuŋunuka; iseki hidikunoŋa kumesu indi, mwalala nimpata yamunu mwishina niantu ejima ashakamamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi yena nahili dehi wukutwesha kwimanaku hinyi? Neyi kuzuwa kwindi kwasweja dehi kutata wukutwesha kushakamaku hinyi? Kulendumuka kwindi anakwichili neyi kesi, malola anayibaluli kudi yena ntwe ntwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova himuwahi, himpwembu yakudikaŋila muntu mwifuku dayihuŋu, yena weluka antu abatamaŋa mudi yena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yena wakakumisha chikupu chipela chakwenoku nadibaji dasumpokaŋa, wakahaŋila ayilumbu jindi mumwidima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi nakumufuukwila Yehova yumanyi? Wakakumisha chikupu; kukaba hikwakanyamuka cheŋi kamuchiyeduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela wena adi neyi nyiŋa yaditaŋila dehi, hela adi neyi antu anakumini dakuzowa nayakunwa yawu, akayinoŋesha zo chikupu neyi chanoŋeshaŋawu ntotu kudi kesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudeyi munafumi muntu wumu wamufuukwilaŋa Yehova yatama, walejaŋa akwawu mpùŋa yatama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Hela Ŋovu jawu jawanina chikupu, nikuvula anavuli, akayitemamu tuhu kwawu, hiyakekala nawa kwokuku. Hela nakukabishi, hinakakukabisha nawa cheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu nukukukotwela mpanda yindi yidi hanshiŋu yeyi, nukukuketula nyonji yakukasawu ngwa ngwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nashimuni dehi nsaŋu yeyi, nindi, Kwosi muntu mukwejina deyi akatu mbawuku. Nukufumisha mwitala dawakishi eyi akishi akusoŋa, niakishi akusupununa. Nukukupundila ŋamu muloŋa wudi watama nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, hamapidi hadi lushindu lwanyendu yanowu wudi nakuleta nsaŋu yayiwahi, wudi nakubidika jakumona kuwunda! Eyi Yuda dyaloŋa yawija yeyi, ilaku yiwadishiililumu. Muloŋa mweyeyi himwakahita chiŋa muntu watamaku; amufumishahu dehi chikupu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
